WEBVTT

01:36.600 --> 01:40.009
[NORTHWARD]

01:40.110 --> 01:42.030
[Episode 27]

01:45.360 --> 01:47.229
[All departure gates except for direct flights to the USA]

01:47.340 --> 01:49.030
[Departure Time]

01:49.130 --> 01:50.660
[Arrivals]

01:53.190 --> 01:54.050
Grandma.

01:54.360 --> 01:56.100
I'm finally in Italy.

01:57.090 --> 01:58.240
Do you remember

01:58.630 --> 02:00.790
the story you told me

02:01.290 --> 02:02.970
about Marford when I was young?

02:04.310 --> 02:06.120
What kind of person was he?

02:06.490 --> 02:08.690
Why did he go to China from Italy?

02:09.410 --> 02:10.699
Who am I?

02:11.200 --> 02:12.610
Where am I from?

02:13.550 --> 02:14.360
This time,

02:14.920 --> 02:16.740
I want to figure them out myself.

02:18.170 --> 02:20.200
Venice has a canal too,

02:21.180 --> 02:22.230
but it's different.

02:23.100 --> 02:24.110
With each passing day,

02:25.140 --> 02:27.430
I miss Flower Street more and more.

02:28.920 --> 02:30.010
I also miss

02:30.230 --> 02:32.060
the courtyard where you used to be.

02:54.320 --> 02:55.180
Mayor Gu,

02:55.320 --> 02:57.640
you didn't have to come in person.

02:57.670 --> 02:58.950
We've confirmed that

02:58.970 --> 03:01.840
this ship was just an ordinary cargo ship.

03:01.870 --> 03:03.150
It's less than 100 years old.

03:03.190 --> 03:05.100
I suggest we…

03:05.500 --> 03:06.270
Are you sure?

03:08.190 --> 03:09.860
Are there no other possibilities?

03:10.610 --> 03:11.490
Mayor,

03:11.880 --> 03:13.180
Curator Chen is right.

03:13.380 --> 03:14.360
Actually,

03:14.400 --> 03:15.880
the district government has been informed

03:16.010 --> 03:17.750
to stop the excavation.

03:17.960 --> 03:20.180
It's going to keep raining.

03:20.210 --> 03:22.579
The drainage and protection work

03:22.600 --> 03:24.480
will consume a lot of manpower and resources.

03:24.700 --> 03:26.490
Our budget is limited.

03:27.250 --> 03:28.310
Let's stop

03:28.400 --> 03:30.579
excavating this ship, shall we?

03:30.910 --> 03:31.870
We should spend the money on

03:31.870 --> 03:33.160
more meaningful projects.

03:37.290 --> 03:38.020
Alright.

03:39.850 --> 03:41.370
I respect your opinions.

03:43.480 --> 03:44.320
Let's stop then.

03:46.570 --> 03:47.610
Guys.

03:48.240 --> 03:49.590
Today is our last day

03:49.590 --> 03:50.590
at the 116th shipwreck

03:50.590 --> 03:51.710
archaeological site.

03:51.930 --> 03:52.310
Mom!

03:52.310 --> 03:53.220
We shall…

03:53.320 --> 03:53.710
Mom!

03:53.710 --> 03:55.360
complete all

03:55.850 --> 03:57.420
-the related paperwork
-Mom!

03:58.000 --> 03:58.630
by 5 p.m.

03:58.630 --> 04:00.190
The excavation finally restarted.

04:00.190 --> 04:01.810
Why are you suddenly stopping it?

04:02.280 --> 04:03.180
Who are you

04:03.310 --> 04:05.750
to ask me that?

04:06.450 --> 04:07.630
My son?

04:07.960 --> 04:08.400
Or…

04:08.400 --> 04:10.280
I'm a volunteer at the shipwreck site.

04:14.270 --> 04:15.860
The decision has been made

04:15.890 --> 04:17.300
and announced.

04:17.600 --> 04:19.610
The shipwreck excavation is stopped.

04:20.000 --> 04:22.260
Don't waste any more time here.

04:23.430 --> 04:25.170
I'm wasting my time?

04:25.890 --> 04:27.770
Then what isn't a waste of time?

04:28.640 --> 04:30.900
Should I sit in an office drinking hot tea

04:30.920 --> 04:32.230
and doing field research

04:32.360 --> 04:33.510
or stay in a library traveling around

04:33.510 --> 04:35.360
through a few hardcover books?

04:35.380 --> 04:37.170
That's not a waste of time?

04:37.280 --> 04:39.540
Yeah, I know you're not satisfied with me.

04:39.700 --> 04:41.630
I didn't listen to you about which college to attend

04:41.680 --> 04:43.270
or about what job to take.

04:43.270 --> 04:44.560
But do you think I'm here today

04:44.600 --> 04:46.360
just to stand against you?

04:48.630 --> 04:50.120
So you know what you've done.

04:51.090 --> 04:51.690
Yes.

04:54.340 --> 04:55.700
You're my son.

04:56.570 --> 04:58.730
I am very disappointed in you.

05:01.030 --> 05:02.440
But today,

05:03.330 --> 05:04.330
we'll only talk about work.

05:04.810 --> 05:05.930
Nothing personal.

05:06.860 --> 05:08.790
I didn't make this decision.

05:09.420 --> 05:11.140
The experts have confirmed

05:11.400 --> 05:12.230
that this ship

05:12.260 --> 05:13.920
has no excavation value.

05:13.940 --> 05:14.960
Mayor Gu.

05:15.510 --> 05:16.190
Mayor Gu.

05:16.190 --> 05:18.680
What does this ship mean to you?

05:18.710 --> 05:21.340
Is it just a cultural site for show

05:21.540 --> 05:24.590
and a mere tool for Honghuai City's application for World Heritage status?

05:24.620 --> 05:25.990
Now that the canal has become a World Heritage Site,

05:26.040 --> 05:27.190
it's of no use to you anymore,

05:27.190 --> 05:28.120
so you're just throwing it away?

05:28.160 --> 05:29.000
You're going too far!

05:30.040 --> 05:31.310
That's total nonsense!

05:32.659 --> 05:33.800
Do you know

05:33.830 --> 05:35.000
what happened on this ship

05:35.000 --> 05:36.560
and who lived on it?

05:36.580 --> 05:37.630
You don't!

05:37.630 --> 05:38.930
They don't!

05:38.950 --> 05:41.640
How can you say it's worthless?

05:42.590 --> 05:45.340
There were real people living on this ship.

05:45.690 --> 05:47.920
They might have been insignificant.

05:47.970 --> 05:49.040
They might have been

05:49.060 --> 05:50.380
of no value at all

05:50.409 --> 05:51.730
in the long history.

05:51.750 --> 05:53.960
But to their descendants and loved ones,

05:53.990 --> 05:56.150
they were of immense value.

05:56.580 --> 05:58.860
And we've been looking for traces.

05:58.890 --> 06:00.690
They could very well be the ancestors

06:00.710 --> 06:01.340
of the uncles and aunts,

06:01.370 --> 06:03.010
grandpas and grandmas in the courtyard.

06:03.030 --> 06:04.950
If I can prove that,

06:04.980 --> 06:05.830
I can prove…

06:05.850 --> 06:08.380
But the government's budget is limited!

06:08.530 --> 06:10.100
Now that the canal has become a World Heritage Site,

06:10.180 --> 06:12.950
the entire Honghuai is facing renovation and reconstruction.

06:13.160 --> 06:14.300
Let me ask you.

06:14.470 --> 06:15.480
Should the government

06:15.510 --> 06:16.540
spend the money

06:16.560 --> 06:17.800
on reconstruction that's closely related

06:17.800 --> 06:19.560
to people's lives

06:19.600 --> 06:20.720
or on a sunken ship

06:20.720 --> 06:21.510
that experts have said

06:21.560 --> 06:23.070
to be worthless?

06:28.480 --> 06:29.030
Okay.

06:31.390 --> 06:32.100
I got it.

06:34.570 --> 06:35.770
Then please allow me,

06:36.320 --> 06:37.830
on behalf of Grandpa Zhou,

06:38.830 --> 06:40.740
my family in the courtyard,

06:43.330 --> 06:45.540
and Ma Siyi to whom I made a promise,

06:46.260 --> 06:48.170
to formally request

06:48.880 --> 06:51.210
that you transfer the excavation of the sunken ship

06:51.230 --> 06:52.250
to me.

06:52.380 --> 06:54.750
I'll raise funds myself to complete the subsequent work.

06:56.550 --> 06:57.980
I'll prove to you

06:58.909 --> 07:01.060
that the place you think is meaningless

07:01.080 --> 07:02.600
will turn out to be meaningful;

07:02.900 --> 07:05.070
on top of choices you think are wrong,

07:05.120 --> 07:06.360
there will be new choices;

07:08.040 --> 07:09.030
the boy

07:09.800 --> 07:12.250
who is worthless in the eyes of the world

07:14.340 --> 07:16.340
will be recognized by his family.

07:21.050 --> 07:23.220
All he needs is just a little trust.

07:55.070 --> 07:55.830
Unload!

08:00.010 --> 08:01.750
Hurry up with the delivery.

08:01.910 --> 08:02.590
Recently,

08:02.620 --> 08:03.670
there's been traffic control.

08:03.690 --> 08:05.160
The driving restriction was only lifted yesterday.

08:05.190 --> 08:06.760
We expect another batch tonight.

08:05.260 --> 08:09.650
[No smoking]

08:07.040 --> 08:08.420
We're already overloaded.

08:08.560 --> 08:09.850
We can't take more parcels.

08:09.790 --> 08:15.840
[You can trust us with your parcels.]

08:09.930 --> 08:11.820
Every station is overloaded now.

08:11.850 --> 08:13.670
You're the last link in the chain.

08:13.850 --> 08:15.150
If you don't release the pressure,

08:15.180 --> 08:16.960
it'll be more chaotic upstream.

08:15.910 --> 08:18.360
♫The words you said linger in my mind♫

08:18.070 --> 08:18.720
Hurry up.

08:19.010 --> 08:21.820
♫I keep asking myself why♫

08:22.170 --> 08:23.240
Parcels are pouring in,

08:23.240 --> 08:24.790
but we can't let our service slip.

08:23.450 --> 08:25.860
♫I'm not good with words♫

08:25.090 --> 08:28.370
[We're the experts in shipping parcels.]

08:25.190 --> 08:26.920
Be careful when sorting.

08:26.610 --> 08:28.630
♫Once again, I was knocked down♫

08:27.160 --> 08:29.160
Leave some time for the delivery colleagues.

08:29.840 --> 08:32.000
I know the workload has been intense lately,

08:29.930 --> 08:30.970
♫The light you see♫

08:31.580 --> 08:32.890
♫Is not my light♫

08:32.059 --> 08:33.690
but we have to get through it.

08:33.730 --> 08:34.610
You hear me?

08:33.860 --> 08:36.000
♫What does it even look like?♫

08:34.740 --> 08:36.080
Yes!

08:36.860 --> 08:37.490
♫But I...♫

08:38.039 --> 08:40.309
♫From the start to the very end, I've never changed♫

08:40.360 --> 08:42.080
[Fenghua Express]

08:41.030 --> 08:42.500
♫In our relationship♫

08:43.289 --> 08:44.790
♫Who ended up the loser?♫

08:45.280 --> 08:46.970
♫Even if we start again♫

08:45.940 --> 08:48.570
[Fenghua Express]

08:47.650 --> 08:48.510
♫I'll still be here♫

08:48.960 --> 08:49.980
♫Every choice we make♫

08:50.680 --> 08:51.800
♫Just leads us back to where we began♫

08:52.670 --> 08:53.670
Lunch at midnight.

08:52.700 --> 08:53.430
♫Endless crossroads♫

08:53.670 --> 08:54.360
Work a bit longer,

08:54.010 --> 08:55.200
♫Emotions out of sync♫

08:54.390 --> 08:55.270
and we'll save on breakfast too.

08:55.760 --> 08:57.150
♫Look at me♫

08:55.960 --> 08:56.630
Eat up.

08:56.670 --> 08:57.510
After eating, get back to work.

08:57.550 --> 08:58.060
Alright.

08:57.790 --> 08:59.260
♫One last time♫

08:58.150 --> 08:58.910
Hurry up and eat.

08:59.910 --> 09:00.600
Fenghua.

08:59.990 --> 09:00.840
♫Endless crossroads♫

09:01.390 --> 09:02.270
Here.

09:01.820 --> 09:03.040
♫Emotions out of sync♫

09:02.270 --> 09:03.320
Eat something.

09:03.440 --> 09:04.840
I'm fine. You eat first.

09:03.610 --> 09:04.930
♫Look at me♫

09:04.950 --> 09:06.140
I'll sort these parcels first.

09:05.610 --> 09:07.060
♫One last time♫

09:06.270 --> 09:07.630
They can deliver them after finishing eating.

09:07.750 --> 09:09.010
It'll get cold if you don't eat now.

09:09.150 --> 09:10.390
It's okay.

09:10.440 --> 09:11.240
Don't worry about me.

09:11.570 --> 09:12.780
You…

09:15.290 --> 09:17.690
♫The words you said linger in my mind♫

09:18.410 --> 09:20.890
♫I keep asking myself why♫

09:22.370 --> 09:25.000
♫I'm not good with words♫

09:25.840 --> 09:28.750
♫Once again, I was knocked down♫

09:28.870 --> 09:29.670
Be careful.

09:29.270 --> 09:30.970
♫Gazing at the stars and the distant sky♫

09:30.110 --> 09:31.160
Have some water.

09:31.560 --> 09:32.850
Have some water. It's already noon.

09:31.760 --> 09:32.680
♫A faint light glimmering♫

09:33.420 --> 09:35.700
♫I'm chasing it all alone♫

09:37.000 --> 09:38.330
♫Watching loneliness fall like rain♫

09:37.780 --> 09:39.080
Fenghua, do you want some water?

09:38.820 --> 09:40.470
♫Shattered by them♫

09:39.080 --> 09:39.840
I'll get it for you.

09:41.000 --> 09:43.560
♫Blooming into flowers once again♫

09:44.320 --> 09:44.790
♫But I...♫

09:45.300 --> 09:47.680
♫From the start to the very end, I've never changed♫

09:48.250 --> 09:49.260
♫In our relationship♫

09:49.890 --> 09:52.040
♫Who ended up the loser?♫

09:52.630 --> 09:53.930
♫Even if we start again♫

09:54.600 --> 09:56.080
Careful, careful!

09:54.690 --> 09:55.400
♫I'll still be here♫

09:55.950 --> 09:57.240
♫Every choice we make♫

09:57.640 --> 09:58.820
♫Just leads us back to where we began♫

09:59.620 --> 10:00.410
♫Endless crossroads♫

10:01.300 --> 10:02.430
♫Emotions out of sync♫

10:03.290 --> 10:04.330
♫Look at me♫

10:05.040 --> 10:06.340
♫One last time♫

10:07.270 --> 10:08.290
♫Endless crossroads♫

10:08.900 --> 10:09.970
♫Emotions out of sync♫

10:10.720 --> 10:11.870
♫Look at me♫

10:12.750 --> 10:14.860
♫One last time♫

10:14.910 --> 10:16.460
The extremely hot weather

10:16.740 --> 10:18.440
ushers in the peak season for food delivery.

10:18.510 --> 10:20.290
We expect that within a month,

10:20.540 --> 10:23.720
our order volume will reach a new high.

10:24.180 --> 10:25.420
Headquarters requires us

10:25.440 --> 10:27.540
to take advantage of this opportunity

10:27.600 --> 10:29.120
to become more competitive.

10:29.360 --> 10:30.420
We should see this month

10:30.440 --> 10:32.030
as the final battle

10:32.110 --> 10:33.270
against other platforms.

10:33.570 --> 10:35.230
Within this month, we need to

10:35.840 --> 10:38.700
narrow the gap with other platforms

10:39.080 --> 10:40.040
and expand

10:40.240 --> 10:41.600
Bee's market share.

10:42.530 --> 10:44.030
We're having this meeting

10:44.030 --> 10:45.480
to discuss

10:45.510 --> 10:47.750
whether we should temporarily raise the commission

10:48.240 --> 10:50.270
to boost the delivery riders' motivation.

10:50.920 --> 10:52.580
An extra yuan per order.

10:58.640 --> 11:00.200
I disagree.

11:01.350 --> 11:02.270
Why?

11:02.770 --> 11:03.870
The so-called temporary solution

11:03.870 --> 11:06.200
can't be temporary.

11:06.560 --> 11:08.040
If we raise it when it's over 38 degrees Celsius,

11:08.060 --> 11:10.270
at what temperature will we lower it?

11:10.950 --> 11:11.660
The reality is that

11:11.690 --> 11:12.770
the commission is easy to raise

11:12.790 --> 11:13.920
but hard to lower.

11:13.950 --> 11:14.670
Once we raise it,

11:14.690 --> 11:16.320
it'll become the new standard.

11:16.630 --> 11:17.790
The money for the delivery riders

11:17.790 --> 11:19.510
can't come from the customers

11:19.550 --> 11:21.110
or the merchants.

11:21.130 --> 11:23.210
It can only be deducted from our profits.

11:23.240 --> 11:24.640
The current situation is that

11:24.670 --> 11:26.540
our profits are as low as they can be.

11:26.760 --> 11:28.070
If we give delivery riders

11:28.140 --> 11:30.070
an extra yuan for each order,

11:30.100 --> 11:31.770
the company will be losing money.

11:31.800 --> 11:34.170
We can tell the delivery riders

11:34.360 --> 11:35.120
that this extra yuan

11:35.270 --> 11:36.550
is a high-temperature allowance.

11:36.600 --> 11:37.390
High-temperature allowance?

11:37.410 --> 11:39.100
What about a low-temperature allowance?

11:39.490 --> 11:41.260
What about allowances for stormy weather?

11:41.610 --> 11:42.440
Mr. Wanghe,

11:42.610 --> 11:44.330
you'll only stay here for a year.

11:44.350 --> 11:46.160
If you set such a high standard for us,

11:46.200 --> 11:46.960
after you leave,

11:46.980 --> 11:48.620
how are we supposed to move on?

11:48.640 --> 11:49.560
Right?

11:49.590 --> 11:51.630
If you insist on going your own way

11:51.660 --> 11:52.880
and raising the commission,

11:52.910 --> 11:54.750
I hope you can get the head office

11:54.770 --> 11:55.610
to make rules about it.

11:55.710 --> 11:57.070
Each district will

11:57.100 --> 11:58.860
strictly follow the rules.

11:58.880 --> 11:59.470
That's no problem.

11:59.500 --> 12:00.570
Am I right, everyone?

12:00.930 --> 12:02.500
Mr. Meng, what do you think?

12:04.700 --> 12:06.220
Rules are rigid,

12:06.380 --> 12:07.450
but people are flexible.

12:08.160 --> 12:09.160
In fact,

12:09.180 --> 12:10.910
in the company's commission standards,

12:11.170 --> 12:12.690
there are already provisions

12:12.710 --> 12:14.510
about temporarily raising the commission during extreme weather.

12:14.870 --> 12:16.660
We're just specifying them.

12:19.640 --> 12:20.640
Let's do this.

12:20.940 --> 12:21.610
Wanghe,

12:22.090 --> 12:23.940
you'll be in charge of raising the commission.

12:24.270 --> 12:25.090
But

12:25.740 --> 12:27.070
after it cools down,

12:27.150 --> 12:28.720
you need to lower

12:28.740 --> 12:29.860
the commission back.

12:29.970 --> 12:31.000
No problem, Mr. Meng.

12:31.850 --> 12:32.980
Next,

12:33.120 --> 12:34.510
our top priority

12:34.550 --> 12:35.720
is to make preparations

12:35.720 --> 12:36.960
to prevent heatstroke.

12:37.260 --> 12:38.230
Each station

12:38.660 --> 12:39.830
needs to prepare

12:40.120 --> 12:41.910
heatstroke medicine and mung bean soup.

12:42.190 --> 12:43.150
In this regard,

12:43.360 --> 12:44.360
Shao Xingchi's

12:44.380 --> 12:46.770
Station 203 in Haidian District

12:46.800 --> 12:47.960
has done a great job.

12:48.250 --> 12:50.010
The delivery riders there are very satisfied.

12:50.050 --> 12:50.600
Additionally,

12:50.620 --> 12:52.570
the system needs to be optimized again.

12:52.970 --> 12:53.570
Haikuo.

12:54.050 --> 12:55.480
How long is the gap

12:55.550 --> 12:57.660
between the time we give to delivery riders

12:57.680 --> 12:58.800
and the time customers expect?

12:59.460 --> 13:01.390
Usually three minutes.

13:01.420 --> 13:03.320
The time shown to customers is 40 minutes,

13:03.350 --> 13:04.700
while the time shown to delivery riders

13:04.720 --> 13:06.200
is 37 minutes.

13:07.850 --> 13:08.490
Mr. Meng,

13:09.650 --> 13:11.350
I suggest we shorten the time

13:11.380 --> 13:12.660
given to delivery riders by another minute.

13:18.900 --> 13:19.880
Everyone,

13:21.170 --> 13:23.380
great rewards will bring forth brave men.

13:23.410 --> 13:25.260
If they can't do it, they don't have to take the order.

13:29.640 --> 13:30.580
Wanghe,

13:31.380 --> 13:32.870
simply shortening the system time

13:32.870 --> 13:34.960
can only bring extensive growth.

13:35.160 --> 13:36.390
Then what's your idea?

13:38.270 --> 13:39.840
It's okay. Just speak your mind.

13:42.780 --> 13:43.620
Mr. Meng.

13:44.250 --> 13:45.810
The delivery riders of Bee

13:45.870 --> 13:47.030
currently use third-party mapping services.

13:47.270 --> 13:49.000
The odds of them providing the optimal routes

13:49.000 --> 13:50.880
haven't reached 90% yet.

13:50.900 --> 13:51.840
To some extent,

13:51.870 --> 13:53.270
this has affected the delivery efficiency.

13:53.270 --> 13:54.120
So I suggest

13:54.150 --> 13:56.000
we launch our self-developed map ahead of schedule.

13:56.080 --> 13:56.720
I've tested it.

13:56.720 --> 13:57.850
It's already very stable.

13:57.880 --> 13:59.970
It only needs final-stage debugging.

14:00.320 --> 14:01.720
Isn't that too risky?

14:01.750 --> 14:02.340
Haikuo,

14:03.190 --> 14:05.330
if you dare to take responsibility for your advice,

14:05.470 --> 14:06.550
I'll dare to heed it.

14:07.000 --> 14:07.670
Do you dare?

14:08.160 --> 14:09.210
Of course.

14:09.510 --> 14:11.070
If anything goes wrong with the self-developed map,

14:11.090 --> 14:12.440
I'll pack up and leave immediately.

14:13.390 --> 14:14.600
Any other suggestions?

14:17.620 --> 14:18.700
If not,

14:18.720 --> 14:20.180
we'll proceed with this plan.

14:20.530 --> 14:21.250
Meeting adjourned.

14:28.290 --> 14:29.290
Haikuo,

14:29.970 --> 14:30.800
stay for a moment.

14:30.820 --> 14:31.980
I want to talk with you.

14:37.960 --> 14:38.600
Sit down.

14:42.220 --> 14:44.420
You're more excellent than I thought.

14:45.870 --> 14:47.470
You flatter me, Mr. Meng.

14:47.640 --> 14:49.160
Are you interested in coming to the headquarters?

14:49.780 --> 14:50.540
Headquarters?

14:52.140 --> 14:53.190
To do what?

14:53.220 --> 14:54.460
To be the Chief Technology Officer.

14:55.610 --> 14:57.320
The previous CTO

14:57.340 --> 14:59.060
was poached by Eat Well.

15:00.000 --> 15:00.920
Well,

15:00.950 --> 15:03.520
compared with having a headhunter poach someone,

15:03.770 --> 15:04.530
I prefer

15:05.110 --> 15:06.470
to promote someone in the company.

15:09.820 --> 15:10.610
Mr. Meng,

15:10.930 --> 15:13.110
Wanghe still needs help.

15:13.300 --> 15:15.440
I need help too.

15:15.670 --> 15:16.430
Haikuo,

15:16.850 --> 15:18.900
you're a genius programmer.

15:19.010 --> 15:20.460
Running around for business with him

15:20.490 --> 15:21.820
is a waste of your talent.

15:24.130 --> 15:24.980
How about this?

15:25.710 --> 15:26.900
Think it over.

15:27.040 --> 15:28.280
Come to me when you've made up your mind.

15:30.740 --> 15:31.860
It's too sudden.

15:32.720 --> 15:34.550
Please let me think about it.

15:34.590 --> 15:35.900
Whether you come or not,

15:35.920 --> 15:37.130
you must keep it a secret.

15:37.420 --> 15:38.970
It involves backend data.

15:38.990 --> 15:39.870
Safety first.

15:49.400 --> 15:50.820
[Bee Delivery]

15:51.030 --> 15:51.870
What's going on?

15:51.720 --> 15:52.380
[Bee Delivery]

15:53.720 --> 15:54.820
Mr. Meng just asked me…

15:57.160 --> 15:59.030
to keep up the good work.

15:59.050 --> 16:00.020
That's all.

16:00.380 --> 16:01.990
He didn't mention anything about a raise?

16:02.370 --> 16:02.980
No.

16:05.850 --> 16:06.450
It's okay.

16:06.470 --> 16:07.470
Keep working.

16:07.850 --> 16:09.520
Once our self-developed map is running smoothly,

16:09.540 --> 16:10.780
I'll apply for it for you.

16:12.640 --> 16:13.440
Where's Xingchi?

16:13.460 --> 16:14.060
Downstairs.

16:15.990 --> 16:17.630
[Fenghua Express]

16:33.080 --> 16:35.260
[Fenghua Express]

16:33.480 --> 16:34.230
Fenghua!

16:34.880 --> 16:35.560
Fenghua!

16:35.940 --> 16:36.970
What's wrong?

16:37.890 --> 16:38.820
Are you okay?

16:39.780 --> 16:41.050
Sit down for a while.

16:41.210 --> 16:42.060
I'm fine.

16:42.670 --> 16:43.900
I didn't have breakfast this morning.

16:43.930 --> 16:45.130
I think my blood sugar's low.

16:47.010 --> 16:47.960
Oh, you silly girl.

16:47.960 --> 16:49.320
How could you skip breakfast?

16:54.650 --> 16:55.500
Have some water.

16:57.580 --> 16:58.750
I'm fine.

16:58.750 --> 17:00.770
Why are you so worried?

17:01.160 --> 17:02.750
You're our backbone.

17:02.790 --> 17:04.109
You can't go down.

17:04.750 --> 17:05.550
I won't.

17:05.550 --> 17:06.510
Don't worry.

17:12.109 --> 17:13.640
Finish the work you have on hand.

17:13.680 --> 17:14.480
I must see it tomorrow.

17:14.510 --> 17:15.680
Even if it means working overtime.

17:20.510 --> 17:21.240
Mr. Xie,

17:21.240 --> 17:22.650
working late?

17:22.670 --> 17:23.480
I'll leave soon.

17:24.310 --> 17:25.359
I'll head off then.

17:26.530 --> 17:28.329
How's the progress on your end?

17:30.810 --> 17:32.100
It's alright.

17:32.540 --> 17:34.230
What do you mean by alright?

17:35.060 --> 17:37.370
Where did you find those people?

17:37.850 --> 17:39.520
They're all so lazy.

17:39.550 --> 17:41.330
Working overtime is killing them.

17:43.510 --> 17:45.640
Just pull your weight.

17:45.740 --> 17:47.290
Why think so much?

17:47.590 --> 17:49.510
If the sky falls, the tall will hold it up.

17:50.120 --> 17:50.890
Alright then.

17:50.910 --> 17:52.010
You hold on.

17:52.350 --> 17:53.160
I'm leaving.

17:53.180 --> 17:54.470
Aren't you having dinner with us?

17:54.590 --> 17:55.240
Another time.

17:55.270 --> 17:56.430
I have plans with Xiaohui.

17:56.500 --> 17:58.340
Your girlfriend before friends, huh?

17:58.590 --> 17:59.750
Zhou Haikuo, you've changed.

18:00.270 --> 18:02.040
You should date someone too.

18:02.090 --> 18:03.920
I know you like being single,

18:04.460 --> 18:06.360
but you can't stay single forever.

18:06.800 --> 18:07.520
Get lost.

18:21.740 --> 18:22.660
Do I look good?

18:24.940 --> 18:26.190
Yes.

18:26.730 --> 18:27.570
Do you like it?

18:27.600 --> 18:28.670
If you do, let's buy it.

18:28.690 --> 18:30.450
It's over 3,000 yuan. Too expensive.

18:30.480 --> 18:31.410
It's fine.

18:31.590 --> 18:33.240
This month, I have overtime pay

18:33.270 --> 18:34.580
and a high-temperature allowance. I can afford it.

18:34.610 --> 18:35.840
And then live off scraps?

18:36.200 --> 18:37.640
I can always earn more in the future.

18:37.790 --> 18:40.090
I'm competent anyway.

18:40.150 --> 18:42.150
You haven't established yourself at Bee yet.

18:42.170 --> 18:43.130
I have.

18:43.170 --> 18:45.010
Mr. Meng had a private talk with me.

18:45.620 --> 18:46.630
What did he say?

18:48.100 --> 18:49.130
He wants me

18:49.390 --> 18:51.680
to work at headquarters as the CTO.

18:51.830 --> 18:53.260
Really?

18:53.800 --> 18:55.340
What exactly did he say?

18:58.080 --> 18:59.310
I didn't agree.

19:00.680 --> 19:01.510
Why?

19:01.960 --> 19:03.880
Wanghe brought me into the company.

19:03.880 --> 19:06.120
I need to discuss this with him first.

19:06.520 --> 19:07.750
Wanghe doesn't know how to code.

19:07.790 --> 19:09.510
What's there to discuss with him?

19:10.260 --> 19:11.260
You don't understand.

19:14.530 --> 19:15.480
No.

19:16.070 --> 19:17.070
I don't understand.

19:17.400 --> 19:18.590
I don't understand anything.

19:19.640 --> 19:20.550
Then from now on,

19:20.550 --> 19:22.060
you don't need to tell me about these things anymore.

19:23.500 --> 19:24.210
Wait.

19:25.090 --> 19:26.480
What did I say?

19:26.820 --> 19:27.510
Wait.

19:27.510 --> 19:28.860
Why are you upset?

19:31.000 --> 19:32.030
You're on your period?

19:32.940 --> 19:34.690
How about I get you some hot water?

19:37.960 --> 19:38.770
What do you want to eat?

19:38.800 --> 19:39.510
My treat.

19:39.540 --> 19:40.550
How about a barbecue?

19:43.310 --> 19:44.500
I know

19:44.680 --> 19:46.000
you and Wanghe are good friends,

19:46.000 --> 19:47.500
and he's helped you a lot.

19:47.880 --> 19:49.070
But you're an adult.

19:49.090 --> 19:51.330
You can only depend on yourself in the future.

19:51.530 --> 19:52.750
I don't want my husband

19:52.750 --> 19:54.270
to be someone who can't even decide

19:54.270 --> 19:56.050
the direction of his own career!

19:58.990 --> 20:00.000
Lion's head meatballs.

20:01.450 --> 20:02.970
Braised shredded tofu.

20:06.260 --> 20:08.000
Stir-fried shredded eel.

20:08.950 --> 20:10.430
Here's rice.

20:10.690 --> 20:11.410
Two servings of rice.

20:14.220 --> 20:16.570
Did you plant a bug on me?

20:17.810 --> 20:19.930
I mentioned this morning that I wanted to eat hometown food,

20:20.000 --> 20:21.000
and you brought it to me.

20:21.400 --> 20:22.270
Don't flatter yourself.

20:22.290 --> 20:23.410
I want to eat it too.

20:23.550 --> 20:24.110
Here.

20:24.130 --> 20:24.760
Eat up.

20:30.850 --> 20:31.890
How's it?

20:33.270 --> 20:34.160
Not quite there,

20:34.180 --> 20:35.110
but not bad.

20:36.550 --> 20:37.720
Haikuo's grandpa used to say that

20:38.640 --> 20:40.560
when you crave hometown food,

20:40.700 --> 20:41.790
you're not missing the food

20:41.810 --> 20:42.680
but feeling homesick.

20:42.810 --> 20:43.530
What?

20:43.870 --> 20:44.740
You feel homesick?

20:44.900 --> 20:45.900
Don't you miss home?

20:46.030 --> 20:46.790
Occasionally,

20:47.140 --> 20:48.680
when I feel wronged.

20:49.020 --> 20:50.250
I barely think about it other times.

20:50.440 --> 20:51.070
What about you?

20:53.240 --> 20:54.510
How did Xiang Yu die?

20:55.050 --> 20:56.350
Surrounded by enemies on all sides.

20:57.160 --> 20:58.740
If a soldier keeps thinking about going home,

20:58.790 --> 21:00.100
he'll lose the courage to fight.

21:00.880 --> 21:01.790
I'm still fighting.

21:02.550 --> 21:04.000
You're a girl.

21:04.240 --> 21:05.640
You can be vulnerable sometimes,

21:05.850 --> 21:06.880
but I can't.

21:07.110 --> 21:08.400
Everyone under me is watching.

21:08.590 --> 21:09.640
I can't let them see

21:09.640 --> 21:10.590
my vulnerable side,

21:10.720 --> 21:11.720
not even once.

21:16.550 --> 21:18.350
I want to eat eel noodles.

21:18.350 --> 21:19.240
I'll make some for you.

21:20.160 --> 21:20.830
Please don't.

21:21.440 --> 21:22.570
Given your cooking skills,

21:22.680 --> 21:24.100
I'd have a fishy taste in my mouth afterward.

21:24.270 --> 21:25.720
And I'd have to praise you against my better judgment.

21:28.350 --> 21:29.680
What's Xingchi been up to lately?

21:30.790 --> 21:32.240
His cooking skills aren't good either.

21:32.590 --> 21:35.000
He learned to make eel noodles from Uncle Zhou.

21:35.030 --> 21:36.150
And lion's head meatballs.

21:38.110 --> 21:39.110
Then go to him.

21:39.740 --> 21:41.520
♫When the moon hangs in the sky♫

21:42.730 --> 21:43.890
♫And it's cooling in the yard♫

21:44.520 --> 21:47.940
♫Who is still by your side?♫

21:47.880 --> 21:48.920
Are you angry?

21:49.200 --> 21:52.600
♫As time passes♫

21:49.790 --> 21:51.160
Seriously?

21:52.510 --> 21:53.880
Do you have to be so possessive?

21:53.810 --> 21:56.950
♫Is a lifetime really that long?♫

21:54.030 --> 21:54.920
Shut up.

21:57.400 --> 21:58.070
Fine.

21:59.070 --> 22:00.000
I'm the one who's possessive.

22:00.570 --> 22:02.390
♫When youthful company fades♫

22:00.640 --> 22:01.860
Let's imagine

22:02.000 --> 22:03.350
we're in a period show.

22:03.410 --> 22:04.880
♫Leaving only small talk and pleasantries♫

22:03.940 --> 22:05.360
Your Majesty.

22:05.590 --> 22:07.220
It's time to take your medicine.

22:05.950 --> 22:09.190
♫Spring feels short, while autumn lingers♫

22:09.270 --> 22:10.000
Are you alright?

22:10.130 --> 22:13.760
♫A gentle breeze carries dreams away♫

22:10.510 --> 22:11.180
What's wrong?

22:13.000 --> 22:13.720
Nothing.

22:15.010 --> 22:18.740
♫Dreamland and dreams♫

22:15.100 --> 22:16.620
-I haven't eaten all day and…
-Sit down.

22:18.280 --> 22:19.150
I'm tired.

22:23.670 --> 22:26.660
♫Life is long♫

22:23.930 --> 22:25.530
What are you thinking?

22:25.910 --> 22:27.090
You're the manager.

22:27.110 --> 22:28.380
You pay people

22:27.870 --> 22:30.840
♫No need to dwell♫

22:28.400 --> 22:29.560
to work for you.

22:29.590 --> 22:30.930
Why are you exhausting yourself like this?

22:30.960 --> 22:32.130
What's the point?

22:32.800 --> 22:35.480
♫Like moonlight♫

22:36.350 --> 22:37.470
Your Majesty…

22:37.340 --> 22:40.200
♫Don't forget♫

22:37.590 --> 22:38.110
Stop fooling around.

22:38.110 --> 22:39.480
I'm serious.

22:42.310 --> 22:43.610
I can't rest.

22:42.560 --> 22:45.420
♫Life is long♫

22:43.690 --> 22:44.880
Why not?

22:46.660 --> 22:48.520
The team is already falling apart.

22:47.030 --> 22:49.830
♫No need to dwell♫

22:48.780 --> 22:50.300
If I don't lead by example,

22:50.680 --> 22:52.000
their resentment will only grow.

22:51.130 --> 22:54.200
♫Like moonlight♫

22:52.090 --> 22:53.520
I planned

22:53.590 --> 22:55.070
to tough it out first

22:55.400 --> 22:56.790
and then hire someone who knows management.

22:55.960 --> 23:00.280
♫The old times♫

22:57.960 --> 22:59.110
When He was here,

22:59.110 --> 23:00.570
he helped me a lot,

23:00.640 --> 23:01.750
so I wasn't so tired.

23:03.160 --> 23:04.480
It's just me now.

23:05.200 --> 23:06.680
I'm struggling to keep it together.

23:09.700 --> 23:11.070
I'll ask He to come back.

23:14.590 --> 23:15.310
No need.

23:16.310 --> 23:17.640
Without him,

23:17.640 --> 23:19.200
I can still keep the station running.

23:20.070 --> 23:20.830
Delicious.

24:18.690 --> 24:22.440
[Bar]

24:19.840 --> 24:22.880
Anyway, she thinks I'm Wanghe's underling.

24:24.690 --> 24:26.590
So she basically thinks I'm a dog.

24:29.990 --> 24:31.490
Why have you come alone?

24:31.740 --> 24:32.590
I just have.

24:34.040 --> 24:35.700
You had dinner by yourself?

24:35.740 --> 24:37.010
None of your business.

24:39.110 --> 24:40.000
Let's drink.

24:46.750 --> 24:47.750
What's wrong with you this time?

24:47.780 --> 24:48.810
You fought with Xiaohui again?

24:50.720 --> 24:51.830
I suspect

24:52.250 --> 24:54.860
Xiaohui has started menopause early.

24:54.950 --> 24:56.150
What's the reason this time?

24:56.170 --> 24:57.300
She's jealous of you.

24:57.330 --> 24:58.530
Jealous of me?

24:59.990 --> 25:01.180
What did I do?

25:01.210 --> 25:04.050
Meng wants Haikuo to be the CTO at headquarters.

25:04.940 --> 25:06.350
Haikuo said he needs

25:06.370 --> 25:07.240
to ask for your opinion first.

25:07.380 --> 25:08.380
Xiaohui is upset about it.

25:10.680 --> 25:11.720
When did that happen?

25:11.770 --> 25:13.120
The day

25:13.160 --> 25:15.240
when Meng talked with me alone.

25:15.310 --> 25:16.750
I asked you what he said,

25:16.780 --> 25:17.380
and you said nothing.

25:17.400 --> 25:18.950
He asked me to keep it a secret

25:19.080 --> 25:21.350
for data security.

25:21.380 --> 25:22.580
I didn't really understand it.

25:22.600 --> 25:24.310
He told you to keep it secret, so you did?

25:25.140 --> 25:27.380
That's not the point, okay?

25:27.440 --> 25:29.030
Shouldn't you be asking

25:29.070 --> 25:30.640
why Xiaohui is upset?

25:30.640 --> 25:32.270
Why is Xiaohui upset?

25:32.460 --> 25:33.710
She thinks…

25:38.010 --> 25:39.000
I don't even want to say it.

25:40.030 --> 25:40.880
Anyway,

25:41.370 --> 25:43.420
recently, every few days,

25:43.460 --> 25:44.770
she picks a fight with me.

25:45.120 --> 25:46.600
It's wearing me out.

25:49.130 --> 25:50.480
Leave her if you can't stand her.

25:51.450 --> 25:52.400
Just break up with her.

25:52.780 --> 25:54.590
You handled things like that,

25:54.610 --> 25:55.790
and you're still single now.

25:55.810 --> 25:57.260
Aren't you single?

25:57.770 --> 25:59.160
I won't be soon.

25:59.220 --> 26:00.810
Wonderful.

26:01.780 --> 26:03.110
Congratulations.

26:10.590 --> 26:12.070
Why are you drinking so fast?

26:12.130 --> 26:13.640
I'm happy.

26:14.070 --> 26:14.920
Waiter!

26:14.960 --> 26:16.030
A 12-pack of beer, please.

26:16.030 --> 26:17.480
Enough. No more drinking.

26:17.480 --> 26:18.470
We still have to work tomorrow.

26:18.490 --> 26:19.480
Worry about yourself.

26:19.510 --> 26:20.720
I know what I'm doing.

26:20.780 --> 26:21.700
It won't affect anything.

26:21.770 --> 26:22.600
Wanghe,

26:23.070 --> 26:24.550
I've thought it through.

26:25.090 --> 26:26.500
Don't worry about Xiaohui.

26:27.530 --> 26:29.860
I won't go to headquarters.

26:37.580 --> 26:38.440
Haikuo.

26:40.810 --> 26:42.120
To be honest,

26:42.140 --> 26:43.820
I really need you right now.

26:44.270 --> 26:46.460
I hope you can stay and help me.

26:48.060 --> 26:50.160
But Xiaohui isn't wrong.

26:51.160 --> 26:52.880
You should decide

26:52.910 --> 26:54.210
your career direction by yourself.

26:54.240 --> 26:56.170
Whether you succeed or fail,

26:56.920 --> 26:58.210
you need to learn

26:59.120 --> 27:01.070
to take responsibility for your own decisions.

27:01.100 --> 27:02.770
You also need to be responsible for Xiaohui.

27:07.580 --> 27:09.300
Why are you looking at me?

27:09.770 --> 27:11.980
Don't you already have the answer in your heart?

27:12.290 --> 27:14.160
Just follow your heart.

27:19.170 --> 27:20.410
What I say goes!

27:20.890 --> 27:22.260
I say I'm not leaving, and that's that!

27:23.870 --> 27:24.560
Come on.

27:25.260 --> 27:26.260
To our friendship.

27:26.280 --> 27:26.950
Cheers!

27:28.130 --> 27:28.680
Cheers!

27:28.700 --> 27:29.360
Cheers!

27:36.720 --> 27:39.460
[Bar]

27:44.140 --> 27:45.350
Mr. Zhou!

27:45.640 --> 27:46.960
Mr. Zhou!

27:47.000 --> 27:48.040
Uncle Shao.

27:48.350 --> 27:50.180
Bingyi, slow down.

27:52.280 --> 27:53.070
Look at him.

27:53.070 --> 27:53.640
Wait for me.

27:54.290 --> 27:55.240
Mr. Zhou.

27:56.050 --> 27:57.020
It's confirmed.

27:57.860 --> 27:59.000
One of my ancestors

27:59.000 --> 28:01.030
indeed worked as a porter.

28:01.030 --> 28:01.750
Really?

28:01.750 --> 28:03.840
But the name is no longer traceable.

28:03.870 --> 28:04.910
Why?

28:05.050 --> 28:06.620
My family genealogy records

28:06.640 --> 28:08.270
were burned during the war.

28:08.300 --> 28:09.950
Only some fragments were left.

28:10.010 --> 28:10.680
Look.

28:10.840 --> 28:12.680
The writing is all blurred.

28:12.840 --> 28:13.960
-Yeah.
-How do I know

28:13.960 --> 28:15.400
this person worked as a porter?

28:15.400 --> 28:17.280
It's because at the end of the Qing dynasty,

28:17.440 --> 28:19.030
this person made a fortune

28:19.030 --> 28:20.380
by selling tea.

28:20.830 --> 28:22.960
He went back and built an ancestral hall for his clan.

28:22.960 --> 28:24.670
That's why it was recorded.

28:26.400 --> 28:28.020
This is history,

28:28.960 --> 28:31.110
the folk history of people living by the canal.

28:32.400 --> 28:33.510
I think

28:33.530 --> 28:35.210
we shouldn't just look into our families.

28:35.240 --> 28:37.450
Our neighbors on Flower Street,

28:37.520 --> 28:38.580
we should ask them all.

28:38.740 --> 28:40.910
Maybe every family has their own

28:41.080 --> 28:41.880
stories.

28:41.900 --> 28:43.010
-Yeah.
-Right?

28:43.290 --> 28:45.640
So this is oral history?

28:46.330 --> 28:48.600
Oral history is still history.

28:48.990 --> 28:50.710
When Sima Qian wrote "Records of the Grand Historian,"

28:50.740 --> 28:52.030
from emperors and generals

28:52.030 --> 28:53.200
to peddlers and porters,

28:53.200 --> 28:55.070
he went door to door to make inquiries.

28:55.070 --> 28:55.750
Yes.

28:55.910 --> 28:56.930
Jing Ke's assassination attempt on Qin Shi Huang

28:57.440 --> 28:59.540
was only recorded in detail

28:59.570 --> 29:01.200
because he ran into Xia Wuju

29:01.220 --> 29:03.460
when he was visiting a neighbor.

29:03.510 --> 29:04.750
Yes, indeed.

29:05.050 --> 29:06.720
We don't have his talent,

29:06.770 --> 29:08.000
but if we put in the effort,

29:08.030 --> 29:09.960
we can also contribute to filling in

29:10.000 --> 29:11.070
the blanks in official history.

29:11.070 --> 29:12.110
Absolutely.

29:12.130 --> 29:13.850
So this will also be considered history in the future?

29:13.880 --> 29:14.610
Of course.

29:15.330 --> 29:16.840
You'll become part of history too.

29:20.310 --> 29:21.320
Gosh.

29:22.750 --> 29:23.750
My dad,

29:23.960 --> 29:24.790
Uncle Shao,

29:24.830 --> 29:25.970
Grandpa Zhou, and I

29:26.200 --> 29:27.880
naturally formed

29:27.960 --> 29:30.070
a four-person research team.

29:30.350 --> 29:31.550
Fueled by passion,

29:30.990 --> 29:34.370
♫At moonset cry the crows♫

29:31.640 --> 29:32.830
we roamed the streets and alleys,

29:32.960 --> 29:34.350
visiting over 100 families

29:34.350 --> 29:36.160
along the canal,

29:36.400 --> 29:37.880
encountering many rare antiques,

29:37.880 --> 29:40.790
and recording countless fascinating stories.

29:41.440 --> 29:42.200
To our surprise,

29:41.530 --> 29:44.710
♫Streaking the frosty sky♫

29:42.440 --> 29:43.960
after the canal's successful World Heritage application,

29:44.270 --> 29:45.640
various folk museums,

29:45.640 --> 29:47.640
big and small, began popping up along the canal.

29:47.780 --> 29:49.400
This gave us a more comprehensive

29:49.400 --> 29:51.270
understanding of its history.

29:51.700 --> 29:52.750
The four of us,

29:52.680 --> 29:56.300
♫Dimly lit fishing boats♫

29:52.960 --> 29:54.680
driven by our obsession with the sunken ship,

29:54.830 --> 29:56.030
somehow became the talk of the neighborhood

29:56.030 --> 29:58.200
around Flower Street.

29:58.750 --> 30:00.000
More and more people

30:00.000 --> 30:01.620
began approaching us,

30:01.190 --> 30:06.370
♫Sadly lie beneath maples♫

30:01.880 --> 30:03.160
offering their help to solve the mystery.

30:04.480 --> 30:05.200
And just like that,

30:05.750 --> 30:07.000
I felt

30:07.240 --> 30:09.500
I was finally getting closer to the truth,

30:09.790 --> 30:11.990
and closer to fulfilling my promise

30:12.270 --> 30:13.440
to Siyi.

30:23.350 --> 30:25.000
Why am I so tired?

30:25.180 --> 30:26.590
It's just the beginning.

30:27.810 --> 30:29.000
It's only been a few days.

30:29.680 --> 30:30.830
You can't handle it already?

30:29.790 --> 30:33.070
♫At moonset cry the crows♫

30:32.750 --> 30:34.270
When I wrote books,

30:34.680 --> 30:36.240
at least I knew the direction.

30:36.670 --> 30:38.400
I was in control.

30:38.680 --> 30:39.550
But now,

30:39.990 --> 30:43.340
♫Streaking the frosty sky♫

30:40.160 --> 30:42.480
everything is uncertain.

30:48.890 --> 30:50.070
Hello?

30:50.960 --> 30:51.700
Yes.

30:51.500 --> 30:55.090
♫Dimly lit fishing boats♫

30:52.130 --> 30:52.890
Really?

30:53.680 --> 30:54.720
Okay, okay.

30:55.000 --> 30:55.750
We'll come right away.

30:55.770 --> 30:57.070
Alright, thank you.

30:57.950 --> 30:58.630
Grandpa.

30:58.670 --> 31:01.050
The town chronicle office says they have new leads.

31:01.080 --> 31:01.730
Is that so?

31:01.810 --> 31:02.640
Then let's pack up and go.

31:02.750 --> 31:03.110
Hurry up.

31:03.160 --> 31:04.070
Let's go.

31:06.200 --> 31:07.640
You may find the information

31:07.680 --> 31:08.640
you're looking for

31:08.640 --> 31:09.920
in their genealogy records.

31:09.960 --> 31:11.000
If you can't find it here,

31:11.000 --> 31:12.290
there's even less chance elsewhere.

31:12.320 --> 31:12.950
This way.

31:13.300 --> 31:14.470
They've been waiting for a long time.

31:14.500 --> 31:15.910
Yes.

31:16.010 --> 31:17.030
Great.

31:21.140 --> 31:22.280
Come on.

31:23.530 --> 31:25.490
This old man is a descendant of the Dong family.

31:25.960 --> 31:26.440
Hello, everyone.

31:26.510 --> 31:26.880
Hello.

31:26.960 --> 31:27.440
Welcome.

31:27.440 --> 31:28.590
They're looking for some information.

31:28.590 --> 31:29.200
Thank you for coming.

31:29.200 --> 31:30.350
Nice to meet you, sir.

31:31.200 --> 31:32.150
Welcome, welcome.

31:33.240 --> 31:37.520
One of my ancestors had a friend surnamed Shao.

31:37.580 --> 31:39.030
There is a record of him.

31:39.060 --> 31:39.860
I've kept it

31:39.880 --> 31:42.480
but forgotten which book it's in.

31:42.610 --> 31:44.460
Help them look for it.

31:44.880 --> 31:45.990
Then let's look for it together.

31:46.010 --> 31:46.730
Okay.

31:46.760 --> 31:48.130
Let's look together.

31:50.590 --> 31:51.620
Okay, thank you.

31:52.770 --> 31:54.480
Sir, is it this?

31:54.990 --> 31:55.710
This.

31:57.260 --> 31:59.250
[I have a friend called Shao Sheng whose father was a canal porter. After leaving, he has not returned for a long time. The chances of survival are slim.]

32:00.690 --> 32:01.390
You found it.

32:01.540 --> 32:02.120
This is it.

32:02.270 --> 32:03.030
Is it?

32:04.480 --> 32:05.480
Great!

32:06.340 --> 32:07.270
Thank you, sir.

32:07.270 --> 32:08.310
Thank you.

32:08.310 --> 32:09.160
Wonderful.

32:09.200 --> 32:10.590
Record it, record it.

32:11.750 --> 32:12.440
It wasn't easy.

32:12.440 --> 32:13.270
Record.

32:13.270 --> 32:14.030
Let's take a picture together.

32:14.030 --> 32:14.440
Take a picture.

32:14.440 --> 32:16.680
Come on.

32:17.110 --> 32:18.480
"I have a friend called Shao Sheng

32:18.660 --> 32:21.190
whose father was a canal porter.

32:21.220 --> 32:23.460
After leaving, he has not returned for a long time.

32:23.510 --> 32:25.070
The chances of survival are slim.

32:25.270 --> 32:27.280
I'm so worried that I can't sleep."

32:30.110 --> 32:31.110
Why are you laughing?

32:31.520 --> 32:32.460
This is your ancestor.

32:32.480 --> 32:35.080
Look, it says, "The chances of survival are slim."

32:35.110 --> 32:36.110
Why are you so happy?

32:36.110 --> 32:37.440
Don't be so insensitive.

32:37.480 --> 32:38.680
It's precisely because he was my ancestor

32:38.680 --> 32:39.680
that I'm happy.

32:39.680 --> 32:41.030
I know he was fine.

32:41.030 --> 32:42.880
Otherwise, we wouldn't be here, right?

32:42.880 --> 32:43.760
Yes.

32:44.480 --> 32:45.240
That's right.

32:46.200 --> 32:48.190
Were porters paid well at that time?

32:48.280 --> 32:49.440
Of course not.

32:49.440 --> 32:50.110
Is that so?

32:50.680 --> 32:51.440
Grandpa…

32:53.460 --> 32:54.160
Where's Grandpa?

32:56.550 --> 32:57.270
Mr. Zhou.

32:59.440 --> 33:00.350
Grandpa!

33:03.290 --> 33:04.010
Oh, no.

33:06.110 --> 33:06.640
Let's go.

33:06.680 --> 33:07.400
Is that him?

33:07.440 --> 33:08.100
Let's go.

33:08.210 --> 33:09.270
Did he go out?

33:09.270 --> 33:10.830
Let's go take a look.

33:12.670 --> 33:14.960
In the first stage, he's forgetful, and in the second stage?

33:14.960 --> 33:16.050
Memory problem.

33:16.580 --> 33:17.310
I see.

33:17.310 --> 33:18.960
So he can't remember anything at all?

33:18.960 --> 33:20.270
-Yes.
-So he'll need someone with him

33:20.270 --> 33:21.310
around the clock?

33:21.310 --> 33:22.000
Yes.

33:23.790 --> 33:24.820
I gotta go.

33:25.530 --> 33:26.920
Is this what it's like when he…

33:26.940 --> 33:27.640
Look.

33:31.160 --> 33:32.400
Mr. Zhou.

33:32.430 --> 33:33.440
Grandpa.

33:35.920 --> 33:36.680
Grandpa.

33:46.530 --> 33:47.170
Rui.

33:48.200 --> 33:48.960
Where are you going?

33:50.440 --> 33:51.130
Grandpa.

33:51.380 --> 33:52.060
Grandpa.

33:53.140 --> 33:55.510
♫Sitting quietly in the city♫

33:53.680 --> 33:55.030
What are you doing here?

33:56.830 --> 33:57.400
We finally found you.

33:56.870 --> 34:00.820
♫Listening to the river flow♫

33:57.440 --> 33:57.750
Mr. Zhou.

33:57.750 --> 33:58.440
Why are you here?

34:00.480 --> 34:01.440
Siyi.

34:01.440 --> 34:01.920
Who?

34:02.110 --> 34:02.550
Who?

34:03.310 --> 34:04.330
It's Siyi.

34:06.000 --> 34:06.770
Listen.

34:07.340 --> 34:10.250
♫Hometown, oh hometown♫

34:08.679 --> 34:09.429
It's her.

34:11.380 --> 34:14.550
♫Now a distant place I can't go back to♫

34:15.780 --> 34:18.310
♫Sitting quietly in the city♫

34:19.290 --> 34:23.810
♫Listening as time drifts by♫

34:26.429 --> 34:30.850
♫The sunsets in the city♫

34:28.440 --> 34:30.360
This girl came a few days ago.

34:30.400 --> 34:32.150
You know, the kind of person who travels on a budget by bike.

34:31.600 --> 34:34.550
♫Hold no poetry, no distant dreams♫

34:32.880 --> 34:34.440
That night at the gathering,

34:34.480 --> 34:36.550
she sang a foreign song for us.

34:35.830 --> 34:39.300
♫Walking through a world like a song♫

34:37.480 --> 34:38.880
When she paid the bill,

34:38.880 --> 34:40.110
she gave me a CD

34:40.440 --> 34:43.840
♫From oblivion to oblivion♫

34:40.960 --> 34:41.880
and said it was her own recording.

34:41.920 --> 34:42.400
Thank you.

34:45.350 --> 34:48.230
♫The love that passed through those remaining years♫

34:45.989 --> 34:47.400
Do you know her name?

34:47.920 --> 34:48.710
Her name?

34:48.760 --> 34:50.150
How could I remember that?

34:49.540 --> 34:52.679
♫Without complaints or piano music♫

34:50.150 --> 34:51.920
So many people come here every day.

34:53.000 --> 34:53.400
Oh, right.

34:53.400 --> 34:54.710
Before she left,

34:53.850 --> 34:56.929
♫The coolness after the gentle breeze♫

34:54.710 --> 34:55.960
I took a photo of her.

34:57.660 --> 35:01.420
♫I'm destined to be like you♫

34:58.750 --> 34:59.550
This one.

35:03.280 --> 35:06.410
[It's You]

35:06.880 --> 35:08.230
Do you have her number?

35:08.370 --> 35:09.160
No.

35:09.440 --> 35:11.680
But she should be abroad by now, I guess.

35:14.260 --> 35:15.800
How do you know that?

35:15.820 --> 35:16.770
She told me.

35:16.790 --> 35:17.630
She said

35:17.670 --> 35:19.840
once she saved enough money, she'd go to Italy

35:20.300 --> 35:21.750
to trace her roots.

35:21.920 --> 35:22.870
Quite interesting.

35:23.010 --> 35:24.080
I'll go back to work.

35:27.100 --> 35:29.020
♫You never hesitate to let me lean♫

35:29.710 --> 35:31.250
♫On your shoulder♫

35:31.420 --> 35:34.440
When I saw the blurred writing that day,

35:34.470 --> 35:36.780
♫The cover page hides this story♫

35:34.880 --> 35:36.280
I doubted we could find anything.

35:37.110 --> 35:37.880
But we did.

35:37.650 --> 35:40.050
♫So many imagined dreams♫

35:37.880 --> 35:38.440
What a relief.

35:38.440 --> 35:39.150
What a relief.

35:39.630 --> 35:40.590
Yes, it's a relief.

35:41.840 --> 35:43.790
♫But I...♫

35:44.500 --> 35:49.550
♫I just want to hold your warm hand♫

35:50.350 --> 35:55.250
♫And gently press it against my chest♫

35:57.540 --> 36:03.820
[It's You]

35:58.820 --> 36:00.250
♫But I...♫

36:01.390 --> 36:06.210
♫I just want to hold your warm hand♫

36:06.680 --> 36:11.980
♫And gently press it against my chest♫

36:09.200 --> 36:14.220
[Flower Street Kids]

36:13.670 --> 36:14.850
♫A faint light shines through the window♫

36:15.580 --> 36:17.700
♫Glowing on a young face♫

36:18.460 --> 36:21.270
♫Nurturing dreams, yet leaving confusion behind♫

36:22.040 --> 36:23.290
♫Time isn't a cure♫

36:23.830 --> 36:27.360
♫But the most bitter truth♫

36:28.690 --> 36:31.900
♫I want to say goodnight to you♫

36:32.770 --> 36:35.920
♫So we won't get lost in the sea of dreams♫

36:33.300 --> 36:34.540
[Flower Street Kids]

36:36.960 --> 36:39.320
♫You loved my fearless youth♫

36:40.750 --> 36:43.850
♫Only sober love remains pure and clean♫

36:43.550 --> 36:45.940
[Flower Street Kids]

36:44.610 --> 36:47.170
♫No matter what's good or bad♫

36:47.870 --> 36:51.550
♫I wish you find love in this lifetime♫

36:49.520 --> 36:52.340
[Flower Street Kids]

36:52.760 --> 36:54.070
♫Don't walk away with regret♫

36:54.550 --> 36:55.930
♫Reunions always come too late♫

36:54.740 --> 36:56.850
[Flower Street Kids]

36:56.750 --> 36:58.280
♫When the heavy rain falls♫

36:58.950 --> 37:02.450
♫I'll be there to hold an umbrella for you♫

37:15.580 --> 37:18.490
♫I want to say goodnight to you♫

37:19.320 --> 37:22.500
♫So we won't get lost in the sea of dreams♫

37:23.250 --> 37:25.990
♫You loved my fearless youth♫

37:27.150 --> 37:30.560
♫Only sober love remains pure and clean♫

37:31.380 --> 37:33.940
♫No matter what's good or bad♫

37:34.710 --> 37:38.180
♫I wish you find love in this lifetime♫

37:39.470 --> 37:40.830
♫Don't walk away with regret♫

37:41.450 --> 37:42.500
♫Reunions always come too late♫

37:43.530 --> 37:45.000
♫When the heavy rain falls♫

37:45.810 --> 37:51.140
♫I'll be there to hold an umbrella for you♫

38:56.870 --> 38:58.730
Eating fried sauce noodles in a bar?

38:59.260 --> 39:00.610
How classy.

39:01.160 --> 39:02.930
The boss made the sauce himself.

39:03.120 --> 39:04.290
It's not for sale. Try some.

39:04.320 --> 39:05.360
No, thanks. I've already eaten.

39:06.540 --> 39:07.430
This is He.

39:07.480 --> 39:08.190
From now on, he'll work in Station 203

39:08.190 --> 39:09.760
as the dispatcher.

39:09.780 --> 39:10.710
Hello, Shao.

39:18.950 --> 39:19.830
Nice to meet you.

39:19.850 --> 39:20.980
Work hard.

39:21.280 --> 39:22.590
Don't embarrass Fenghua.

39:28.400 --> 39:28.920
Alright.

39:29.200 --> 39:31.180
You two shall work together from now on.

39:32.240 --> 39:33.280
You can go back to work.

39:33.320 --> 39:34.150
We need to talk about something.

39:37.080 --> 39:39.120
This guy is very capable.

39:39.140 --> 39:40.670
He can help you.

39:42.640 --> 39:43.840
Whatever you say.

39:44.880 --> 39:45.650
I have no objections.

39:46.110 --> 39:47.200
Cut it out.

39:47.480 --> 39:48.910
Your hostility towards him

39:49.080 --> 39:50.170
is so obvious.

39:50.950 --> 39:52.510
He was trained by Fenghua.

39:53.360 --> 39:54.840
I'm not comfortable using him.

39:58.110 --> 39:58.760
I've already

39:59.170 --> 40:00.760
discussed it with Fenghua.

40:00.920 --> 40:01.940
Don't worry.

40:02.800 --> 40:03.880
Since you've already discussed it,

40:03.880 --> 40:04.800
there's no need to ask for my opinion.

40:04.980 --> 40:06.060
I'll just do as you say.

40:08.110 --> 40:09.180
Thank you, Li.

40:09.280 --> 40:10.760
You're welcome. Come anytime.

40:24.300 --> 40:26.900
Xingchi was just angry for me.

40:27.110 --> 40:29.300
He knows He once worked for me.

40:31.980 --> 40:33.480
Job-hopping is illegal, huh?

40:35.030 --> 40:36.580
Just be grateful that I have a big heart

40:36.610 --> 40:38.110
and let him go without a fuss.

40:41.260 --> 40:42.400
What would you do

40:42.760 --> 40:44.140
if you wanted to make a fuss?

40:46.130 --> 40:47.670
There are countless ways

40:47.880 --> 40:49.820
to give an employee a hard time.

40:50.480 --> 40:51.480
It's not that I'm not capable of it.

40:51.480 --> 40:52.230
I just don't want to do it.

40:55.580 --> 40:57.450
If we weren't close,

40:57.540 --> 40:59.260
and I poached your staff with high salaries

40:59.890 --> 41:01.620
and publicly humiliated you,

41:01.650 --> 41:02.550
what would you do?

41:02.680 --> 41:03.630
It's simple.

41:04.370 --> 41:05.170
I'd use shady services.

41:05.210 --> 41:06.630
I'd rent hundreds of phone numbers

41:06.760 --> 41:07.800
to place orders continuously.

41:07.820 --> 41:09.170
When the delivery riders arrive at the restaurants,

41:09.200 --> 41:10.550
I'd cancel the orders.

41:11.540 --> 41:13.350
If I did this every day during peak hours,

41:13.370 --> 41:14.370
you'd be out of business in no time.

41:14.510 --> 41:16.100
You're ruthless.

41:16.550 --> 41:17.920
It's just the beginning.

41:18.470 --> 41:19.520
There are plenty of ways

41:19.550 --> 41:21.070
to screw with someone.

41:21.650 --> 41:22.760
You have no idea

41:22.800 --> 41:24.440
what I've been through all these years.

41:31.920 --> 41:32.930
Ms. Xia,

41:34.190 --> 41:35.070
I hate to trouble you, but…

41:36.050 --> 41:38.000
Could you write down all those dirty tricks

41:38.030 --> 41:39.440
for me?

41:40.400 --> 41:42.950
I'll have them patch up the system right away.

41:42.980 --> 41:43.620
Okay?

41:45.330 --> 41:46.640
What's in it for me?

41:47.430 --> 41:48.360
What do you want?

41:53.770 --> 41:54.610
The Mid-Autumn Festival is coming up.

41:54.810 --> 41:55.450
You know.

41:58.330 --> 41:59.080
No problem.

42:02.760 --> 42:03.510
Here.

42:03.530 --> 42:04.800
Here is a spare battery.

42:04.920 --> 42:05.780
Don't charge it.

42:06.360 --> 42:07.370
There are more inside.

42:09.200 --> 42:10.510
What's wrong with your bike?

42:10.590 --> 42:11.680
The brakes seem to be broken.

42:11.740 --> 42:12.860
Brakes?

42:14.730 --> 42:16.400
The tires need changing too.

42:19.520 --> 42:20.330
Chief, Chief.

42:20.350 --> 42:21.410
I need to use your bathroom.

42:23.330 --> 42:24.470
You bought a new car?

42:24.490 --> 42:25.440
It's rented.

42:25.670 --> 42:26.870
Tomorrow is the Mid-Autumn Festival.

42:27.000 --> 42:28.800
I've already arranged leave for you and Haikuo.

42:28.820 --> 42:29.650
We'll drive home.

42:29.680 --> 42:30.540
Now?

42:31.230 --> 42:32.550
Get off. Make room for the new driver.

42:32.550 --> 42:33.160
Next,

42:33.190 --> 42:34.190
let's welcome

42:34.190 --> 42:37.510
Shao Xingchi, the driver for the Tongzhou section.

42:39.230 --> 42:40.200
I see.

42:40.380 --> 42:42.350
You just need me to drive.

42:42.380 --> 42:43.560
Nonsense.

42:43.880 --> 42:45.210
-You're important.
-Haikuo.

42:45.230 --> 42:45.760
Hurry up.

42:45.800 --> 42:47.010
Coming!

42:48.310 --> 42:49.720
The driver has changed?

42:50.110 --> 42:50.790
I'll give it a try.

42:50.810 --> 42:52.110
You don't need to use the bathroom?

42:52.460 --> 42:53.500
Maybe you should.

42:53.520 --> 42:54.450
Get ready.

42:54.480 --> 42:55.230
Let's go!
